{"id":"n40093-1-7","stage":4,"title":"긍정 · 肯定","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40093-1-7-1","ko":"다른 의견이 없으면 모두 긍정을 하는 것으로 받아들이겠습니다.","zh":"如果没有其他意见，我就当作大家都同意了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의견이","meaning":"意见","explanation":"의견：意见；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의견","audio":"/audio/1eaed37a207480d88b78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71118","senseId":"1","lemma":"의견","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없으면","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"긍정을","meaning":"肯定","explanation":"긍정：肯定；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"긍정","audio":"/audio/d7cd27be0534818f1c52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40093","senseId":"1","lemma":"긍정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"作为，当作","explanation":"하다：作为，当作；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것으로","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아들이겠습니다.","meaning":"接受","explanation":"받아들이다：接受；겠：表示意愿、推测